# Copy to .env and set for your machine (.env is gitignored).

# A ready D2 1.14d install to hardlink from — must contain d2data.mpq, Game.exe, etc.
# For run.sh (HEADLESS dedicated server) this can be a slim data-only install built
# with tools/make-minimal.sh — the server stubs out all rendering, so it needs no
# palettes/sprites/media.
D2GS_GAME_SRC=/path/to/your/d2/install

# For run-client.sh (HEADED maphack client) you need a FULL install with real media
# MPQs (~270MB d2data.mpq) — a stripped/minimal data-only dir makes the headed
# renderer null-deref in D2WinPalette. Easiest: symlink it in the repo (gitignored):
#   ln -s /path/to/114Clean ./114clean
# run-client.sh defaults to ./114clean. Or set the path explicitly:
# D2GS_CLIENT_SRC=/path/to/full/114Clean

# Your own legit D2 install — source for tools/make-minimal.sh (no game data is
# shipped in this repo; the recipe copies from here). See LEGAL.md.
# D2_INSTALL=/path/to/your/Diablo II

# A dbghelp.dll proxy that forwards real dbghelp exports and LoadLibrary's the
# DLLs passed via `-loaddll <winpath>` on the command line.
D2GS_DBGHELP=/path/to/dbghelp.dll

# Optional:
# D2GS_TESTDIR=./testgame
# WINE=wine
